{"chapter": "properties", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "054B", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "MATH_0002": "$X$", "MATH_0003": "$X$", "MATH_0004": "$X$", "MATH_0005": "$X$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-quasi-separated-quasi-compact-open-retrocompact}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:d0a2ee1a766644d46f7808a0f950917eb7025d59852f3421e32add12c254c3c3", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:0acd2012fd4658dfd14f4ec3a02ad15ee2f60c9c0222b9a68adaf233f77b898a", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a quasi-separated scheme. The intersection of any two\nquasi-compact opens of <MATH_0002> is a quasi-compact open of <MATH_0003>.\nEvery quasi-compact open of <MATH_0004> is retrocompact in <MATH_0005>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:713345603d226f16ab7b11edc4a6cdd46b7fb012bc2073873bdcededb0933ef4", "unit_id": "tag:054D:statement"}
