{"chapter": "properties", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "054B", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "MATH_0002": "$X$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-quasi-compact-quasi-separated-spectral}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:9651110046b3737a3aaba5f8ec6e85e5c672b54bb1c97d235ddf35facbbc4cf3", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7058e6b49f151051306899b8f9edc8184c8493eee9eac39556077128fcf63a04", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a quasi-compact and quasi-separated scheme.\nThen the underlying topological space of <MATH_0002> is a spectral space.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:a88136446b7b952a95c37dfcba163fe0d5fe0cee3ce077429e5a2736b35c43eb", "unit_id": "tag:094L:statement"}
